<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Arestes" data-copy-zh="Arestes">Arestes</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Reach Arestes’s Hidden Chamber, join the Thieves Guild, and distinguish personal events from guild services." data-copy-zh="找到 Arestes 所在的隐藏密室，加入盗贼公会，并分清个人事件与公会服务的条件。">Reach Arestes’s Hidden Chamber, join the Thieves Guild, and distinguish personal events from guild services.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Fencing_and_Guild_Protection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Phantom_Stone_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Mask_Between_Us"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Private_Ledger"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Highest-Reward_Scene_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Guild_Ranks_and_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_Arestes_and_Joining_the_Guild"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Arestes — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/arestes.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Arestes — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/arestes.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Arestes — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Arestes handles the Thieves Guild’s initiation, specialist lessons and later personal route. Guild rank and completed guild scenes open the relationship chain; her service unlocks and personal affection are separate requirements.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p><strong>Hidden Chamber inside the Thieves Guild: all day, every day.</strong> From Back Alleys, the public guild entrance opens 22:00–04:59, or 20:00–04:59 after The Early Watch. Inside the guild, Secret Door requires <strong>Lockpicking and Perception 60</strong>. Once inside, Arestes remains available; for an earlier evening date, enter in advance and wait inside.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Route_Walkthrough"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Use the guild missions to build the early relationship. Initiation gives only a small affection reward; Talk itself requires Acknowledged (10). Completing the rank scenes matters, rather than merely holding enough Clout.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Step</th><th scope="col">Requirements and cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Thieves Guild Initiation</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">30 min; Shadow Known (25), Rogue 35; Shadow does not have to be in the room</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Guild progression</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Follow Shadow’s Trail, complete guild rank scenes and reach Shadowblade (rank 6, 120 Clout); complete The Arrangement at the public guild</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Guild Pretends Not to Know</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Enter Hidden Chamber; Known (25), rank 6 scene and The Arrangement complete</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Private Ledger</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Known (25), previous scene; 60 min, 10 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Seat Beside the Master</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Re-enter Hidden Chamber; Known (25), previous H2H and The Guild Pretends Not to Know</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stargazing with Arestes</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Known (25), A Seat Beside the Master; 19:00–22:59; 150 min, $30, 30 Energy; +10 Calm; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Mask Between Us</th><td data-label="Requirements and cost">Friend (100), Stargazing and The Private Ledger; 60 min, 10 Energy; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>The Early Watch</strong> triggers in Hidden Chamber once both Arestes and Keira are Friend (100); this extends the outer guild’s opening hours. For <strong>The Phantom Stone Raid</strong>, enter the public guild with Shadow recruited and active, all three of Arestes, Keira and Shadow at Romantic (800), and both Thieves Gloves and Dark Consolador owned. It is a one-time acquisition route when you do not already hold Phantom Stone. Afterwards, The Phantom Stone Awakens is a separate Hidden Chamber scene; the stone’s effect does not wait for that scene.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Action_Reference"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Personal action</th><th scope="col">Requirements, cost and limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Arestes</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Acknowledged (10); 20 min; +1 base affection; three/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Investment Savvy</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Known (25), Intelligence 19; 120 min, $500, 50 Energy; learn once, +10 base affection</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Assassin</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">350 guild Clout; 300 min, 150 Energy, 150 Calm; unlock Assassin once; Clout is a threshold, not payment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dark Consolador</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">500 guild Clout; 30 min; one-time key item, no Clout payment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rooftop Appointment</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">Romantic (800), No Mask Between Us; 19:00–23:59; 120 min, 50 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rooftop Arrangement</th><td data-label="Requirements, cost and limit">1,300 affection and same H2H; 19:00–23:59; 120 min, 50 Energy; +80 base affection, once/day; supporter access</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Rooftop Appointment is a branching private visit. Its affection comes from your choices; the current private-visit system allows another visit after it finishes. Rooftop Arrangement is a separate animation with its own daily use. Her favorite stats are Rogue, Ability and Perception, and Blackmail improves the relationship bonus. A favorite Wine listed in her profile does not create a direct gift action.</p><p>After completing Burglar (rank 3, 25 Clout), A Discreet Arrangement is a 15-minute introduction to commissions. Dispatch a hunt through the later service, wait three full days, then collect before starting another; costs and loot packages are in the Thieves Guild guide. Arestes also fences Valuables. Request Guild Protection needs the Rose &amp; Thorn business, 180 Clout and $10,000, once. At In Love (3,000), owning Phantom Stone opens her 60-minute daily bond for one stone level; see Soul Stones for shared limits.</p><p>Time windows below are <strong>start times</strong>; 22:59 is the last minute of a window ending at 23:00. Base affection is adjusted by the relationship bonuses; direct affection is added as listed.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Cannot reach Arestes: opening the public guild is not enough; Secret Door also checks Lockpicking and Perception 60.</li><li>Initiation is blocked: check Shadow Known (25) and Rogue 35, including active modifiers.</li><li>No personal H2H: finish The Arrangement and the actual rank 6 scene, then trigger The Guild Pretends Not to Know in Hidden Chamber.</li><li>Stargazing starts before 23:00; the later rooftop actions allow starts through 23:59. Enter the outer guild earlier if needed.</li><li>A commission does not finish early after resting one night. Wait three full days from dispatch and collect the existing hunt first.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — affection stages and reward bonuses</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-thieves-guild.html">Thieves Guild — access, ranks, heists and commissions</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones — acquisition and daily bonding</a></li><li><a href="character-shadow.html">Shadow — discovery, recruitment and guild trail</a></li><li><a href="character-keira.html">Keira — The Early Watch and gloves</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-specialist-class.html">Specialist paths — Assassin</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">Investments — Investment Savvy</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fencing_and_Guild_Protection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Phantom_Stone_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Mask_Between_Us"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Private_Ledger"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Heart_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Highest-Reward_Scene_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Guild_Ranks_and_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_Arestes_and_Joining_the_Guild"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Arestes 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/arestes.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Arestes 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/arestes.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Arestes 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Arestes负责盗贼公会入门、专门课程，以及后续个人路线。个人路线需要公会阶级与已完成的公会事件；服务解锁条件和个人好感是分开的。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p><strong>盗贼公会内的隐藏密室，全天可见。</strong>从后巷进入公会的时段为22:00–次日04:59；完成“提前值夜”后提前至20:00。公会内的“暗门”需要<strong>开锁和感知60</strong>。进入密室后，Arestes一直可见；想参加较早开始的夜间约会，可以预先进入并在里面等待。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Route_Walkthrough"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>前期通过公会任务积累关系。入门只给少量好感，普通交谈需要先达到已遇见（10）。除了声望数值，还要实际完成相应升阶事件。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">步骤</th><th scope="col">条件与消耗</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">盗贼公会入门</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">30分钟；Shadow已知（25），玩家盗贼35；不要求Shadow同时在密室</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">推进公会</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">沿Shadow的踪迹推进，完成公会升阶事件，达到第6阶影刃（声望120）；在公会大厅完成“安排”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">公会假装不知情</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">进入隐藏密室；已知（25），完成第6阶事件和“安排”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私人账册</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">已知（25），完成上一事件；60分钟、10精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">坐在大师身旁</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">再次进入隐藏密室；已知（25），完成上一谈心及“公会假装不知情”</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与 Arestes 观星</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">已知（25），完成“坐在大师身旁”；19:00–22:59；150分钟、$30、30精力；恢复10镇定；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">你我之间没有面具</th><td data-label="条件与消耗">朋友（100），完成观星及“私人账册”；60分钟、10精力；仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>“提前值夜”</strong>在Arestes与Keira都达到朋友（100）后，于隐藏密室触发，会延长外侧公会入口的开放时间。<strong>“幻影之石突袭”</strong>需要Shadow已加入并处于启用状态，Arestes、Keira和Shadow都达到浪漫感（800），持有盗贼手套与暗影慰藉者，然后进入公会大厅。尚未持有幻影之石时，可通过此一次性路线获取。之后隐藏密室还有独立的“幻影之石觉醒”事件；石头效果并不需要等这场事件才生效。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Action_Reference"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">个人行动</th><th scope="col">条件、消耗与次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Arestes 交谈</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">已遇见（10）；20分钟；基础好感+1；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学习投资眼光</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">已知（25）、智力19；120分钟、$500、50精力；只学一次，基础好感+10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">刺客</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">公会声望350；300分钟、150精力、150镇定；仅一次，开启刺客；声望是门槛，不会扣除</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">暗影慰藉者</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">公会声望500；30分钟；一次性关键物品，不扣声望</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">屋顶之约</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">浪漫感（800），完成“你我之间没有面具”；19:00–23:59；120分钟、50精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">屋顶安排</th><td data-label="条件、消耗与次数">好感1300，并完成同一谈心；19:00–23:59；120分钟、50精力；基础好感+80，每天1次；需要支持者内容权限</td></tr></tbody></table><p>“屋顶之约”是有分支选择的私人相处，好感由所选回答累积；目前结束后仍可再次开始。“屋顶安排”则是独立动画，有自己的每日次数。她偏好的属性为盗贼、能力和感知，勒索可提高关系加成。资料中偏好葡萄酒，不等于头像菜单有直接送酒行动。</p><p>完成第3阶窃贼（声望25）后，可用15分钟的“秘密约定”认识委托服务。派出一次搜寻后，等满三天并领取，才能再派下一次；费用与战利品档位见盗贼公会指南。Arestes也可替贵重品销赃。“请求公会保护”需要拥有玫瑰与荆棘、公会声望180及$10,000，只能购买一次。达到恋爱中（3000）且持有幻影之石后，可用60分钟进行每日共鸣，让石头提升1级；共同次数规则见灵魂石指南。</p><p>下表时间均指<strong>开始行动的时间</strong>；例如，结束于23:00的时段，最晚可在22:59开始。基础好感会受关系加成影响；直接好感按所列数值增加。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>见不到Arestes：公会大门开放还不够，暗门另外检查开锁与感知60。</li><li>无法入门：检查Shadow是否已知（25），以及盗贼是否达到35（含当前加成）。</li><li>个人谈心没出现：先完成“安排”和实际的第6阶事件，再去隐藏密室触发“公会假装不知情”。</li><li>观星必须在23:00前开始，后续屋顶行动则可到23:59；必要时预先进入公会。</li><li>委托不会睡一晚就完成；从派出时刻起等满三天，并先领取已有委托。</li></ul></section>
